<http://data.silknow.org/object/4291e6c2-60eb-34f7-886d-19ebac1b775c>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Parasol with cream Maltese lace on silk canopy, carved ivory stick with coral tip, made in England, 1830-1870"@en , "Eight-sided parasol of white ribbed silk covered in English tape lace and Maltese silk lace. The tube is made of carved ivory with a hinged joint to allow it to fold down to half the length. The joint is secured with an engraved silver collar, showing delicate flowers and a zigzag edging. The tube ends with another silver collar and a branch of red coral."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/777b5670-226d-3fa6-8452-5e4830e568df> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/f89855be-d088-3bab-ad76-f2dc76d5e349> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/56a89f79-f56e-3f5a-89ce-b5f7be9d2384> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/d1c3dd03-c08d-3bd1-a967-63f752772ca6> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/5fbbc193-7425-3a82-b712-fda7737a6f29> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/bdcc773a-0a05-30f6-a674-d4142e149cc2> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/e0a17521-7790-34d4-af1f-1aef0b40b85c> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/61780c4f-5ec8-3b01-b89d-3f3142c52790> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/3247f891-ac2d-34a0-a08a-d9ac50a0f9e2> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/275ddb41-5331-3970-90d8-7501abdb7950> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Eight-sided parasol of white ribbed silk covered in English tape lace and Maltese silk lace. The tube is made of carved ivory with a hinged joint to allow it to fold down to half the length. The joint is secured with an engraved silver collar, showing delicate flowers and a zigzag edging. The tube ends with another silver collar and a branch of red coral."@en , "Parasol with cream Maltese lace on silk canopy, carved ivory stick with coral tip, made in England, 1830-1870"@en ;
